## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3 Pro
- **Short description:** Google's deprecated previous-generation Pro multimodal reasoning model with a 1M-token context window (shut down in Google AI docs; superseded by Gemini 3.1 Pro and Gemini 4).
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API (`gemini-3-pro-preview`, shut down; 1 provider tracked on Artificial Analysis).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-11-18 release; knowledge cutoff January 1, 2025.
- **IDs:** `google/gemini-3-pro-preview` (no Free ID on OpenCode Zen)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens input, verified via Artificial Analysis.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, speech, and video input; text output; reasoning enabled.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** $2.00 / 1M input tokens, $12.00 / 1M output tokens (90% cache discount; $1.74/1M blended 7:2:1).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary.

